        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>法国甜品介绍</title>\n<style>\n  * {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    background: #f5f0e8;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .container {\n    max-width: 780px;\n    width: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf8f0 0%, #f9f0e0 50%, #fdf5eb 100%);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 30px 35px;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .container::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(255,220,150,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%),\n                radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 80%, rgba(255,200,100,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n\n  .row:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .image-col {\n    flex: 0 0 160px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding-right: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .image-placeholder {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: #f0e8d8;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #999;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .image-placeholder img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n  }\n\n  .label {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #c47a2a;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #333;\n    text-align: justify;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .text-col .french-name {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n\n  /* Specific image sizes */\n  .img-calissons {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 90px;\n  }\n\n  .img-coussin {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n\n  .img-ile {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n\n  .img-tarte {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 110px;\n  }\n\n  .img-poire {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 110px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder-box {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #aaa;\n    background: #f5edd8;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n\n  <!-- Row 1: Calissons -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"image-col\">\n      <div class=\"image-placeholder img-calissons\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-box\">[Image: Calissons 卡里颂糖]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"label\">卡里颂糖</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <span class=\"french-name\">Calissons</span>卡里颂糖是一种传统的法国糖果，由光滑、淡黄色、均匀的蜜饯（尤其是甜瓜和橙子）和杏仁粉组成，上面覆盖着一层薄薄的糖霜。它们的质地类似于杏仁软糖，但具有更浓郁的果味和明显的甜瓜味。通常呈杏仁状，长约五厘米。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 2: Coussin de Lyon -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"image-col\">\n      <div class=\"image-placeholder img-coussin\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-box\">[Image: Coussin de Lyon 里昂枕巧克力]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"label\">里昂枕巧克力</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <span class=\"french-name\">Coussin de Lyon</span> 是里昂高级手工巧克力，绿色外皮是杏仁泥，中间有深色的直线，内馅是调了些许橙酒的黑巧克力馅。以用杏仁和巧克力、柑橘清香闻名于世。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 3: Île flottante -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"image-col\">\n      <div class=\"image-placeholder img-ile\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-box\">[Image: Île flottante 漂浮岛]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"label\">漂浮岛</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <span class=\"french-name\">Île flottante</span> 这个具有神秘又有趣名称的甜品是法国经典甜品之一。白白胖胖的蛋清浮在蛋奶做成的英式卡仕达酱上，就像是一座无人小岛。可爱又美味。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 4: Tarte au citron -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"image-col\">\n      <div class=\"image-placeholder img-tarte\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-box\">[Image: Tarte au citron 柠檬塔]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"label\">柠檬塔</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <span class=\"french-name\">Tarte au citron</span>，一款历史悠久的美食，从南法城市Menton开始流行。每年的二、三月都会举办柠檬节，城中以柠檬与鲜花制作的花车游行最为盛名。在塔皮挤入柠檬奶油馅，再以蛋白饼或蛋白霜装饰，是现在常见的柠檬塔形式。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Row 5: Poire à la Beaujolaise -->\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"image-col\">\n      <div class=\"image-placeholder img-poire\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder-box\">[Image: Poire à la Beaujolaise 红酒炖梨]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"label\">红酒炖梨</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <span class=\"french-name\">Poire à la Beaujolaise</span>，法国博若莱葡萄酒产区的传统甜点，果味红酒搭配糖或蜂蜜、丁香、胡椒、香草荚等香料炖煮梨，梨充分入味，甜软飘香。\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
